# =====================================================================
# LIDER CRM — Cloudflare Pages headers (2026-08-18 r2)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ATUALIZAÇÃO 2026-08-18 (r2) — REFORÇO DE INVALIDAÇÃO DE CACHE NO DEPLOY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Motivo: fix de notif órfã (20260818orfanotifR2) altera JS já servido
# como `immutable, max-age=31536000`. Precisa que:
#   1) TODAS as entradas HTML (index/app/app-lite) sejam SEMPRE no-store,
#      pra que o `<meta name="lf-build-id">` novo chegue no browser.
#   2) O checker (js/app-update-checker.js) veja o build-id diferente e
#      dispare _doCleanReload(), que também limpa Cache Storage.
#   3) O querystring `?v=20260818orfanotifR2` nas <script> mude a URL dos
#      arquivos afetados — URL nova = fora de cache, mesmo com immutable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ATUALIZAÇÃO — cap PBKDF2 do runtime Cloudflare Workers (workerd)
# =====================================================================
# • expõe X-LF-Iter-Cap em /api/* e assets (debug do runtime)
# • Access-Control-Expose-Headers atualizado p/ incluir X-LF-Iter-Cap
# • Tools (tools/*.html) NÃO recebe cache de 1 ano (devem ser frescas)
# • /app-lite.html AGORA também é no-store (era omissão)
# =====================================================================

/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(self), camera=()
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/app.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/app-lite.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/404.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/functions/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=UTF-8

#/api/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: X-LF-Iter-Cap, X-LF-Login-Source, ETag
  X-LF-Iter-Cap: 100000

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/js/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/js/patches/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=UTF-8

/tools/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/sql/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/*.js
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=UTF-8

/src/*
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=UTF-8
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
